@startuml
title SplitSmart logical components and dependency direction
top to bottom direction
package "Presentation adapters" { [Browser] as Browser; [Swing MVP] as Swing }
package "Application use cases" { [Identity / Groups] as Groups; [Expenses / Approval] as Expenses; [Payments / Corrections] as Finance; [Balances / Reports] as Queries }
package "Domain" { [Membership authorization] as Auth; [Money / Allocation] as Allocation; [Approval policy] as Policy; [Financial journal] as Journal }
package "Infrastructure adapters (TBD)" { interface "Repository + transaction" as Repo; [Receipt adapter] as Receipt; [Outbox dispatcher] as Outbox; [Delivery provider] as Provider }
Browser --> Groups
Browser --> Expenses
Browser --> Finance
Browser --> Queries
Swing --> Groups
Swing --> Expenses
Swing --> Finance
Swing --> Queries
Groups --> Auth
Expenses --> Auth
Expenses --> Allocation
Expenses --> Policy
Finance --> Journal
Queries --> Auth
Queries --> Journal
Groups ..> Repo
Expenses ..> Repo
Finance ..> Repo
Queries ..> Repo
Expenses ..> Receipt
Expenses ..> Outbox
Outbox --> Provider
note bottom: Dependencies point inward. Infrastructure implements ports; technology unselected.
@enduml
